@@ -4,12 +4,21 @@ A small team notes app. Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind.
 
 ## Status
 
-- Users live in `src/lib/users.ts` as an in-memory list.
+- Users live in Postgres (Drizzle ORM). Typed queries are in `src/lib/users.ts`; schema in `src/db/schema.ts`.
 - `/dashboard` shows the current user and the team.
 - There is no sign-in, no billing, and no email yet.
 
 ## Develop
 
+```bash
+cp .env.example .env      # placeholder credentials
+docker compose up -d      # local Postgres
+npm run db:migrate        # apply drizzle/ migrations
+npm run db:seed           # optional sample users
+```
+
+After editing `src/db/schema.ts`, run `npm run db:generate` to create a migration.
+
 ```bash
 npm run dev
 ```
